ood timing with Game of Thrones  premiering over the weekend  when you play fallen Legion you win will  you die virtual reality is all about  transporting you to other places and  lone echo takes you all the way to the  rings of Saturn something weird is  happening at the mining facility there  so you'll have to float around the space  station and other out-of-this-world  environments solve puzzles and figure  out what's really going on in space no  one can hear you scream but they might  still hear an echo yeah that sounded a  lot better in my head  anyway lone Echo comes to the oculus  rift on Thursday the 20th and finally  there's another bunch of puzzles to  solve this week  Layton's mystery journey catriel and the  millionaire's conspiracy stars Layton's  daughter Kat who's on a quest to figure  out why her father has vanished she's  joined by her talking dog Shirl and her  friends Emiliana and Ernest the  millionaire's conspiracy comes to iOS  and Android devices on the 20th but  you'll have to wait till later this year  for the 3ds version in the West and  those are the biggest games we'll be  playing this week as always remember  that release dates are based on retailer  listing to enter subject to change  thanks for watching guys and I'll be  back with more games next week

